WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
The eighth day is over. You have only two more days left.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
Out of these two, only one day to work seriously.

00:17.000 --> 00:25.000
Even one day is good enough if one really works, works seriously.

00:26.000 --> 00:31.000
Works exactly as the technique wants you to work.

00:33.000 --> 00:36.000
You get so much benefits.

00:39.000 --> 00:48.000
Another important thing, keep on understanding the technique properly,

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
so that even going back home, you will make use of this technique properly, you will practice properly, you will apply this technique.

